  "releaseNotes": "Latest: v1.6.1 — Documentation fix: Added v1.6.0 release notes to package (apologies for the oversight!). v1.6.0: Error Simulation & Context Management! Test client error handling with 4xx/5xx status codes via query params, headers, shape, or body. API Context Management endpoints (/api/contexts) to view, inspect, and modify context history programmatically. See RELEASE_NOTES.md for full details.",
